{"version":1,"content":"<p>前英特爾行政總裁帕特·基辛格近日表示，半導體行業不能僅依靠漸進式晶片改進來滿足人工智能的算力需求。他認為，AI計算效率需要實現約1萬倍的跨越式提升，而摩爾定律並未走到盡頭，而是需要通過更根本性的技術突破被「喚醒」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587398.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:43:53.600873+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:21:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:37:11.146073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T11:37:11.146073+00:00","content_hash":"6d276d907e944e49775d316d11b26b31d79e32013236ae44a11980c4322b399a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}